# LiveInfo: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_LiveInfo.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen IRICE-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
setup FAKEPLAYER_TRACK="|Artist" python3 sandbox/tools/fakeplayer.py &
wait 2
shot no-title
note the pill (and rows) say "Playing", not the player's name

look glass
setup FAKEPLAYER_TRACK="|Artist" python3 sandbox/tools/fakeplayer.py &
wait 2
shot no-title
note the pill (and rows) say "Playing", not the player's name
